"The device labels this tap as dry, but measured sustained upper notes can collapse before CoreAudio receives them." = "设备把这一路标为干信号，但实测持续高音会在送达 CoreAudio 之前衰减消失。";
"The devices would not take the sample rate the canceller needs." = "这些设备不接受回声消除器所需的采样率。";
"The echo canceller could not be built." = "无法建立回声消除器。";
"The echo canceller would not start." = "回声消除器无法启动。";
"The far-end reference is present." = "已取得远端参考信号。";
"The hook sits in front of every allocation the whole process makes, so it is a measurement to switch on rather than leave running." = "该钩子会拦下整个进程的每一次内存分配。测量时开启，测完关闭。";
"The input and the output cannot be the same device." = "输入与输出不能是同一个设备。";
"The installed YunAudio virtual audio driver is out of date. Reinstall the driver included with this version to receive the latest features and fixes." = "已安装的 YunAudio 虚拟音频驱动程序版本较旧。请重新安装此版本随附的驱动程序，以获取最新功能与修复。";
"The interpreter could not be started." = "无法启动解释器。";
"The light ring did not acknowledge shutdown before the deadline. YunAudio will contain it by exiting." = "灯环未能在时限内确认关闭。YunAudio 将通过退出应用来隔离它。";
"The local service is ready for MCP clients. This does not mean a client is connected." = "本地服务已准备接受 MCP 请求；不代表已有客户端连接。";
"The lyric index is rate limiting us. It usually clears in a minute." = "歌词索引在限流。通常一分钟内会恢复。";
"The lyric services asked YunAudio to wait." = "歌词服务要求稍后再试。";
"The lyric services could not be reached." = "无法连接歌词服务。";
"The menu bar also provides these actions when the main window is closed." = "主视窗关闭时，也能从选单列执行这些操作。";
"The microphone and the speaker share no sample rate." = "麦克风与扬声器没有共同的采样率。";
"The microphone is muted and the system's own voice detector can hear you. It has echo cancellation, so this is you rather than the speakers." = "麦克风已静音，而系统的语音检测仍听到说话。该检测自带回声消除，因此这是你而不是扬声器。";
"The microphone renders nothing itself — every effect is computed here, so the ring can show the level and turn red the moment you mute." = "所有效果都在此计算，因此灯环可显示电平，并在静音时转红。";
"The microphone stays muted until the key is down. Switching it off puts the mute back where it was." = "麦克风保持静音，按住指定按键时才开启。关闭该功能会恢复原先的静音状态。";
"The microphone the canceller needs is no longer there." = "回声消除器需要的麦克风已不存在。";
"The microphone was unplugged; carrying on with another." = "麦克风已拔出，改用其他设备继续。";
"The microphone's own gain, before its converter. Set loud speech around -12 to -6 dBFS. Too high clips before the trim below; too low raises noise." = "麦克风自身的增益，位于转换之前。请把大声说话的峰值调到 -12 至 -6 dBFS；太高会在下方数字电平之前削波，太低会抬高噪声。";
"The microphone's own zero-latency monitoring, done in the device. What comes back is the raw capsule — nothing this application does is in it." = "麦克风自带的零延迟监听，在设备内部完成。返回的是未经处理的原始信号。";
"The mix says what the far end heard. A file per source says what each of you said, which no amount of editing can recover from a mix." = "混音文件是对方听到的内容；每个来源各一个文件，记录的是各自发出的声音。";
"The next line stays legible so the singer can prepare." = "下一句保持清楚，让演唱者能提前准备。";
"The output was unplugged; carrying on with another." = "输出设备已拔出，改用其他设备继续。";
